WEBVTT

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:18.060
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:18.060
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:24.140
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:24.140
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:40.910
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:40.910
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:45.920
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:45.920
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:56.300
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:56.300
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:00:56.470 --> 00:01:01.720
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:00:56.470 --> 00:01:01.720
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:07.520
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:07.520
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:12.530
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:12.530
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:17.610
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:17.610
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:22.490
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:22.490
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:28.290
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:28.290
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:34.130
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:34.130
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:01:37.050 --> 00:01:41.310
<i>The mysterious world where Digimon live,
the Digital World.</i>

00:01:42.310 --> 00:01:46.810
<i>Taichi Yagami and the Chosen Ones
with their partner Digimon</i>

00:01:46.810 --> 00:01:50.650
<i>head to a new stage in their adventure.</i>

00:01:51.690 --> 00:01:54.030
<i>The ISS fell toward Tokyo.</i>

00:01:54.820 --> 00:01:59.450
<i>Koshiro and the group somehow managed
to change its trajectory.</i>

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:02.620
<i>Tokyo had escaped danger.</i>

00:02:05.790 --> 00:02:10.130
<i>Meanwhile, for some reason,
Mimi was enjoying herself,</i>

00:02:10.130 --> 00:02:13.510
<i>surrounded by unfamiliar Digimon
and gemstones.</i>

00:02:13.510 --> 00:02:16.670
<i>What in the world happened to Mimi?</i>

00:02:17.420 --> 00:02:22.260
<i>And will Taichi's group be able to
safely reunite with Mimi?</i>

00:02:23.350 --> 00:02:26.640
MIMI-CHAN WARS

00:02:31.690 --> 00:02:35.190
Alright! Let's gather some food!

00:02:36.070 --> 00:02:37.490
Let's go!

00:02:37.490 --> 00:02:40.180
Let's all split up and search!

00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:45.370
Oh, Hikari-chan and Takeru-kun,
make sure you two don't go too far.

00:02:45.370 --> 00:02:46.250
Okay.

00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:49.580
If anything happens,
I'll be sure to protect Hikari!

00:02:49.580 --> 00:02:51.690
I swear it on my life!

00:02:51.690 --> 00:02:53.690
Patamon, we're counting on you too.

00:02:53.690 --> 00:02:56.800
Okay, I'll be playing with Takeru!

00:02:56.800 --> 00:02:58.760
That's not what he meant.

00:02:58.760 --> 00:03:02.010
Huh? Tailmon, you wanna play with us too?

00:03:09.020 --> 00:03:11.730
Remember we're taking them back
to everyone!

00:03:12.100 --> 00:03:16.440
Oh, sorry!
I'll drop it down, so catch it for me!

00:03:18.110 --> 00:03:19.570
Huh?

00:03:19.570 --> 00:03:21.660
Then I'll help from below.

00:03:29.660 --> 00:03:30.370
Sora!

00:03:30.790 --> 00:03:32.870
Taichi?! Agumon?!

00:03:37.920 --> 00:03:38.880
Sora?!

00:03:40.550 --> 00:03:41.780
Piyomon!

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:42.930
Okay!

00:03:43.430 --> 00:03:44.590
Wait...

00:03:46.810 --> 00:03:48.600
-Wait? What?
-Huh?

00:03:48.600 --> 00:03:49.540
What?!

00:03:49.540 --> 00:03:51.770
Wait for me!

00:03:51.770 --> 00:03:54.400
Sora!

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:04.200
We survived... somehow.

00:04:04.610 --> 00:04:09.060
I'm sorry.
If I had just evolved right away...

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:12.910
Nah... it's all our fault.

00:04:15.330 --> 00:04:18.800
These rocks are kind of shiny.

00:04:22.970 --> 00:04:24.510
What's that?!

00:04:28.350 --> 00:04:30.680
Huh?!

00:04:35.150 --> 00:04:36.820
What are these guys?!

00:04:35.940 --> 00:04:38.060
GOTTSUMON

00:04:36.820 --> 00:04:38.730
They're Gottsumon!

00:04:39.230 --> 00:04:42.900
Hasn't something like this
happened before?

00:04:43.530 --> 00:04:44.880
Huh?

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:47.950
Taichi-san? Sora-san?

00:04:47.950 --> 00:04:49.240
Mimi-chan!

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:51.830
I'm so glad!

00:04:51.830 --> 00:04:56.040
Just when we needed
some excellent manpower!

00:04:56.580 --> 00:04:57.540
Huh?

00:05:02.210 --> 00:05:03.510
A castle?

00:05:06.430 --> 00:05:08.520
What's that sound?

00:05:08.520 --> 00:05:11.200
What a very creepy noise.

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:13.810
So, whose castle is it?

00:05:13.810 --> 00:05:18.310
This is the lair of the Digimon
who rules over this area.

00:05:19.150 --> 00:05:23.210
<i>That Digimon rounded up the Gottsumon
who were originally living here</i>

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:26.470
<i>and forced them to work
in the castle undergrounds!</i>

00:05:26.470 --> 00:05:30.580
<i>And everything that's dug up
only goes to the boss!</i>

00:05:31.030 --> 00:05:32.910
It's just like a sweatshop!

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:38.080
The wave of social issues have already
reached this Digital World!

00:05:41.290 --> 00:05:43.300
What are they digging up?

00:05:43.920 --> 00:05:44.710
Well...

00:05:45.300 --> 00:05:46.300
this!

00:05:47.010 --> 00:05:49.220
That's a very pretty stone.

00:05:49.720 --> 00:05:50.720
<i>This is...</i>

00:05:50.720 --> 00:05:55.370
<i>the Ruby of the Maiden's Passionate Heart
Sparkling in the Beautiful Sunset!</i>

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:58.480
Ruby... is that right?

00:05:58.480 --> 00:06:02.320
Hmm... it sure looks like it.

00:06:02.320 --> 00:06:04.360
We have lots more!

00:06:04.820 --> 00:06:08.950
This one is the Sparkling Sapphire of Life
Shimmering in the Night Sky!

00:06:08.950 --> 00:06:13.330
And, this is the Heart-Throbbing Emerald
of Fresh Green Grass!

00:06:13.330 --> 00:06:15.750
We have tons more!

00:06:16.580 --> 00:06:18.120
Those are some names...

00:06:18.710 --> 00:06:21.420
Mimi and I named them!

00:06:21.420 --> 00:06:25.840
Now, if we just had diamonds,
it'd be perfect.

00:06:27.050 --> 00:06:30.310
Aside from their names,
they are pretty all right.

00:06:30.310 --> 00:06:32.680
So these are buried all over the place?

00:06:33.180 --> 00:06:36.900
They say there's especially a bunch
underneath that castle,

00:06:36.900 --> 00:06:38.940
so they're trying to dig them out.

00:06:39.480 --> 00:06:45.820
Gottsumon and me, forced to work.

00:06:45.820 --> 00:06:48.950
Rest not allowed.

00:06:49.320 --> 00:06:51.700
Then all of you here are...

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:55.870
They're all the Digimon
that barely escaped alive from that place.

00:06:55.870 --> 00:06:58.710
So, while they were hiding in the rocks,

00:06:58.710 --> 00:07:00.960
Palmon and I flew in.

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:06.550
<i>They thought we were spies from the castle
at first and chased us around.</i>

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:14.240
<i>But the fierce exchange of fists
between Togemon and Golemon lasting days!</i>

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:16.600
<i>And the storm of craze and excitement!</i>

00:07:17.020 --> 00:07:20.100
<i>They solved
the misunderstanding between us!</i>

00:07:23.690 --> 00:07:29.240
By the time we noticed, we had clicked
and Mimi-chan's second kingdom was born!

00:07:29.240 --> 00:07:31.260
So that's what happened.

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:32.660
Alright!

00:07:33.160 --> 00:07:37.330
Now that we have
some excellent manpower here,

00:07:37.330 --> 00:07:40.270
we can finally commence the project!

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:41.960
Project?

00:07:41.960 --> 00:07:42.750
Yeah!

00:07:43.790 --> 00:07:46.750
We're gonna squash that castle!

00:07:48.300 --> 00:07:51.970
You want to help the suffering Digimon!

00:07:51.970 --> 00:07:53.260
Admirable!

00:07:53.260 --> 00:07:55.970
I'll never forgive them!

00:07:55.970 --> 00:07:56.910
Uh-huh!

00:07:57.680 --> 00:08:00.480
How could they hog a load of gemstones?!

00:08:00.480 --> 00:08:01.520
What?!

00:08:04.560 --> 00:08:10.990
My grandpa, Tachikawa Heavy Industries
Chairman Genichiro Tachikawa, always said,

00:08:11.440 --> 00:08:15.740
<i>"A workplace where people are rewarded
for their hard work and can smile...</i>

00:08:16.320 --> 00:08:19.910
<i>That is how
Tachikawa Heavy Industries ought to be!"</i>

00:08:20.580 --> 00:08:24.670
Forcing people to work day and night
until they're exhausted,

00:08:24.670 --> 00:08:27.840
and having a good time all by oneself!

00:08:27.840 --> 00:08:31.510
I cannot overlook such tyranny!

00:08:33.680 --> 00:08:35.390
R-Right...

00:08:35.390 --> 00:08:38.140
I don't really understand, but awesome!

00:08:38.140 --> 00:08:40.690
I don't really understand, but impressive!

00:08:40.690 --> 00:08:44.060
Looks like everyone's really up for it.

00:08:44.060 --> 00:08:48.610
Now then, everybody,
I'm gonna have all of you get to work!

00:08:50.400 --> 00:08:51.740
I work hard!

00:08:52.070 --> 00:08:57.660
Because I'm Mimi's servant No. 99!

00:08:58.120 --> 00:08:59.000
What?

00:08:59.000 --> 00:09:04.670
Taichi-san's No. 72
and Sora-san's No. 73, right?

00:09:04.670 --> 00:09:07.090
Oh, now that I think about it...

00:09:07.090 --> 00:09:10.170
I remember something like that...

00:09:10.630 --> 00:09:12.820
Don't you guys forget!

00:09:12.820 --> 00:09:17.340
For today, you'll be my employees
instead of my servants, okay?

00:09:18.140 --> 00:09:23.650
Nice to meet you. No. 72, No. 73.

00:09:23.650 --> 00:09:25.270
Y-Yeah.

00:09:25.270 --> 00:09:26.830
Nice to meet you.

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:28.530
Now then!

00:09:28.530 --> 00:09:34.210
Let the Mimi-chan Kingdom & Mimi-chan
Company Workplace Improvement Project

00:09:34.210 --> 00:09:35.590
begin!

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:37.450
Yeah!

00:09:37.950 --> 00:09:41.700
I feel like we were all
just pushed into this though.

00:09:47.080 --> 00:09:50.840
I understand, Taichi-san.
We'll head over there as well.

00:09:51.750 --> 00:09:53.470
That being said...

00:09:53.470 --> 00:09:57.260
I wonder how far they all went.

00:09:57.590 --> 00:10:03.060
I wish there was positional tracking
on the Digivice at times like this.

00:10:03.060 --> 00:10:06.480
Let's just move along this river for now.

00:10:07.560 --> 00:10:08.620
Huh?

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:11.480
Aren't we drifting away from the river?

00:10:16.530 --> 00:10:17.570
W-What?!

00:10:17.570 --> 00:10:18.870
Komondomon's asleep?!

00:10:18.870 --> 00:10:21.510
You can't fall asleep on the wheel!

00:10:21.510 --> 00:10:25.160
-Wake up!
-Get up!

00:10:34.050 --> 00:10:35.220
Birdramon!

00:10:35.220 --> 00:10:36.880
Let's show them what we got!

00:10:37.340 --> 00:10:39.380
GOBURIMON

00:10:41.470 --> 00:10:43.390
SUNARIZAMON

00:10:43.760 --> 00:10:44.850
Here it comes!

00:10:44.850 --> 00:10:46.220
Going up!

00:10:49.480 --> 00:10:51.980
We're going
to draw the lookouts' attention.

00:10:52.610 --> 00:10:57.910
Sunarizamon
shoots sand from mouth. Dangerous.

00:10:57.910 --> 00:11:01.280
But cannot reach high.

00:11:01.280 --> 00:11:02.140
Okay.

00:11:03.450 --> 00:11:05.700
Up next is Taichi's group!

00:11:20.130 --> 00:11:23.390
Phew, that was actually a lot of work!

00:11:23.390 --> 00:11:25.620
Yes, we worked hard!

00:11:25.620 --> 00:11:29.230
No, the one who worked hard
to dig the hole was...

00:11:32.650 --> 00:11:35.900
You capture Gottsumon living in peace

00:11:35.900 --> 00:11:38.880
and force hard labor onto them
without any rest!

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:44.240
Any wicked boss who dares
to treat diligent workers poorly...

00:11:44.740 --> 00:11:49.000
will be laid off by me, Mimi Tachikawa!

00:11:53.170 --> 00:11:54.750
Watch out, Mimi-chan!

00:11:55.460 --> 00:11:58.780
No. 72! Go teach them a lesson!

00:11:58.780 --> 00:12:00.970
What? Us?!

00:12:01.300 --> 00:12:03.280
Well, okay...

00:12:03.280 --> 00:12:05.510
-Let's do it, Greymon!
-Yeah!

00:12:12.940 --> 00:12:15.320
Now, tell us!

00:12:15.320 --> 00:12:18.980
Where are all the sparkly stones
you dug up?!

00:12:20.570 --> 00:12:24.490
"Very top," says Goburimon.

00:12:24.490 --> 00:12:25.820
Top, okay!

00:12:26.410 --> 00:12:28.080
We're going too!

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:29.200
Okay.

00:12:30.450 --> 00:12:31.330
What?

00:12:32.830 --> 00:12:34.500
Wait, hey!

00:12:35.710 --> 00:12:37.880
While Sora-san is being the bait,

00:12:37.880 --> 00:12:42.740
we're gonna dig a tunnel underground,
rescue the Gottsumon, and escape!

00:12:43.490 --> 00:12:45.110
What about the plan?!

00:12:45.110 --> 00:12:46.640
Plan B now!

00:12:46.640 --> 00:12:48.620
We'll leave this to you!

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:52.350
Plan B? I didn't hear about this!

00:12:56.560 --> 00:12:57.650
Greymon!

00:12:57.650 --> 00:12:58.690
Yeah!

00:12:59.110 --> 00:13:00.320
Mega Flame!

00:13:05.150 --> 00:13:07.220
I'm kind of worried.

00:13:07.220 --> 00:13:10.870
Taichi, I got this!

00:13:10.870 --> 00:13:13.120
Thanks. Good luck!

00:13:13.750 --> 00:13:17.830
Hey! I'm coming too, Mimi-chan!

00:13:19.460 --> 00:13:22.010
Look. There.

00:13:23.510 --> 00:13:24.610
A lookout?

00:13:24.610 --> 00:13:26.970
The gemstones must be there!

00:13:29.640 --> 00:13:30.760
Palmon!

00:13:32.140 --> 00:13:34.640
Palmon Evolution!

00:13:37.350 --> 00:13:38.980
Togemon!

00:13:43.740 --> 00:13:48.030
How's that?!
That's our special bonus for you!

00:13:48.030 --> 00:13:51.160
Ugh, looks like a painful bonus.

00:13:57.120 --> 00:13:58.810
Incredible!

00:13:58.810 --> 00:14:01.840
Are these all gemstones?

00:14:01.840 --> 00:14:04.320
That's right! Look!

00:14:04.320 --> 00:14:06.470
This one looks like topaz!

00:14:06.470 --> 00:14:08.600
This one looks like amethyst!

00:14:08.600 --> 00:14:10.950
Rubies and sapphires too!

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:12.600
You look happy.

00:14:12.600 --> 00:14:13.560
Yes!

00:14:14.140 --> 00:14:17.520
And now, I have an important announcement!

00:14:17.520 --> 00:14:18.310
What?

00:14:18.850 --> 00:14:23.570
As of now, Taichi-san will be appointed
to our company's transport chief!

00:14:23.570 --> 00:14:25.190
Go, Chief!

00:14:25.570 --> 00:14:28.090
A chief this young?

00:14:28.090 --> 00:14:28.990
Ouch!

00:14:30.740 --> 00:14:32.700
What's this?

00:14:35.120 --> 00:14:36.350
Isn't this...

00:14:36.350 --> 00:14:38.790
I bet it's a diamond!

00:14:38.790 --> 00:14:41.460
It's my first time finding a diamond here!

00:14:41.460 --> 00:14:43.630
And a big one at that!

00:14:43.630 --> 00:14:46.380
Oh, this is like a dream!

00:14:46.880 --> 00:14:48.930
Aren't you glad, Mimi?

00:14:48.930 --> 00:14:53.220
Yes! Let's name this one
the Tachikawa Diamond!

00:14:54.140 --> 00:14:55.440
This sound!

00:14:55.440 --> 00:14:57.810
It's what we heard outside the castle!

00:15:02.980 --> 00:15:05.960
Hey, are the rocks over there...

00:15:05.960 --> 00:15:07.740
...being eaten?!

00:15:08.490 --> 00:15:12.120
Not enough. Not full enough.

00:15:12.870 --> 00:15:17.040
My stomach will not stop growling!

00:15:20.330 --> 00:15:21.080
Oh!

00:15:21.460 --> 00:15:24.840
So that diamond earlier was spit out
by that Digimon too.

00:15:25.960 --> 00:15:27.680
Hey, you there!

00:15:27.680 --> 00:15:28.840
Mimi-chan?!

00:15:35.300 --> 00:15:38.140
Gogmamon, an Ultimate Digimon.

00:15:36.640 --> 00:15:38.850
GOGMAMON

00:15:39.680 --> 00:15:42.850
What are you doing, eating my gemstones?!

00:15:43.270 --> 00:15:47.360
Everything in this castle is mine.

00:15:47.360 --> 00:15:51.090
You're gonna breach the Antimonopoly Act!

00:15:51.090 --> 00:15:55.450
Is my snack today... you?

00:15:55.450 --> 00:15:56.700
Today?

00:15:56.700 --> 00:15:58.160
Snack?

00:15:58.660 --> 00:16:01.500
You look tastier than Gottsumon.

00:16:02.370 --> 00:16:05.710
Gottsumon?! Don't tell me you were...

00:16:10.720 --> 00:16:13.220
I won't forgive you!

00:16:18.600 --> 00:16:21.730
Giant Grater!

00:16:27.650 --> 00:16:29.730
Togemon! Golemon!

00:16:32.820 --> 00:16:34.030
Golemon!

00:16:36.120 --> 00:16:37.410
Are you okay?

00:16:37.410 --> 00:16:38.700
Yeah...

00:16:44.620 --> 00:16:47.920
That Digimon... strong.

00:16:49.090 --> 00:16:52.420
Run... Mimi!

00:16:53.630 --> 00:16:55.050
Golemon...

00:17:01.020 --> 00:17:04.310
Stop!

00:17:07.940 --> 00:17:09.320
Mimi-chan...

00:17:10.820 --> 00:17:16.610
Everything inside this castle,
rocks or Digimon,

00:17:17.490 --> 00:17:19.050
are all mi--

00:17:19.050 --> 00:17:20.330
They're mine!

00:17:20.740 --> 00:17:21.910
She said it.

00:17:22.620 --> 00:17:23.750
That's why...

00:17:24.620 --> 00:17:26.500
I won't leave anyone behind.

00:17:27.380 --> 00:17:32.360
This Digimon is our beloved employee!

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:35.860
So I won't ever leave Golemon behind!

00:17:35.860 --> 00:17:38.840
Togemon Super Evolution!

00:17:43.620 --> 00:17:44.680
Lilimon!

00:17:46.190 --> 00:17:49.480
Giant Grater!

00:17:52.150 --> 00:17:54.130
Flower Cannon!

00:18:05.370 --> 00:18:06.580
What's going on?

00:18:08.120 --> 00:18:11.090
Curse Reflection!

00:18:23.600 --> 00:18:25.580
Lilimon, now!

00:18:25.580 --> 00:18:27.440
Okay! Flower...

00:18:29.600 --> 00:18:30.580
Cannon!

00:18:30.580 --> 00:18:33.690
Curse Reflection!

00:18:42.660 --> 00:18:44.850
Did you see that, Mimi-chan?!

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:45.790
Yeah!

00:18:47.000 --> 00:18:49.460
Lilimon, use this!

00:18:51.000 --> 00:18:51.860
Mimi!

00:18:51.860 --> 00:18:54.720
But that's your precious...

00:18:54.720 --> 00:18:55.720
It's okay!

00:18:55.720 --> 00:18:59.430
I have other things
that are more precious!

00:19:03.140 --> 00:19:06.870
Take this, Mimi's determination!

00:19:07.640 --> 00:19:10.730
Curse Reflection!

00:19:16.610 --> 00:19:19.990
You can't bite through diamonds, can you?!

00:19:20.490 --> 00:19:22.990
That's why you were spitting them out!

00:19:23.660 --> 00:19:24.870
Taichi!

00:19:25.660 --> 00:19:27.040
Greymon!

00:19:27.040 --> 00:19:28.250
Taichi!

00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:29.500
What happened?!

00:19:30.370 --> 00:19:32.330
My grandpa used to say...

00:19:33.830 --> 00:19:37.530
<i>"The employees who work with you
are precious family."</i>

00:19:38.710 --> 00:19:41.740
This is the cost of neglecting that!

00:19:41.740 --> 00:19:44.680
Here we go!

00:19:45.760 --> 00:19:47.240
You're...

00:19:47.240 --> 00:19:49.580
Fired!

00:20:10.790 --> 00:20:12.460
You did it, Mimi-chan!

00:20:12.460 --> 00:20:14.880
Lilimon was awesome too!

00:20:14.880 --> 00:20:17.020
Yeah, very!

00:20:17.020 --> 00:20:19.930
Seriously, what a great leader.

00:20:19.930 --> 00:20:23.030
Leader...

00:20:23.030 --> 00:20:27.140
Our... president.

00:20:34.940 --> 00:20:37.150
Everyone, take care!

00:20:37.150 --> 00:20:39.920
Golemon, I leave the rest to you!

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:45.910
I work hard as acting president
for Mimi-chan Company.

00:20:45.910 --> 00:20:50.160
So that Mimi can return any day.

00:20:50.160 --> 00:20:53.660
No. 72, No. 73...

00:20:54.040 --> 00:20:57.920
please take care of President Mimi.

00:20:57.920 --> 00:21:01.070
Yeah. You do your best too, No. 99.

00:21:01.070 --> 00:21:03.050
Gottsumon too!

00:21:06.470 --> 00:21:07.680
Hey!

00:21:10.260 --> 00:21:16.310
The word "company" has
another meaning besides "workplace"!

00:21:17.060 --> 00:21:18.610
And that's...

00:21:20.480 --> 00:21:23.240
That's "friends"!

00:21:24.610 --> 00:21:26.780
Mimi!

00:22:31.260 --> 00:22:33.010
<i>The Digimon Encyclopedia!</i>

00:22:34.140 --> 00:22:35.310
<i>Leomon.</i>

00:22:35.310 --> 00:22:38.230
<i>The Digimon of justice also known
as the Noble Hero.</i>

00:22:35.390 --> 00:22:38.140
LEVEL: CHAMPION

00:22:38.230 --> 00:22:42.860
<i>The Jyuoken launched from
that super-toned body is ultrapowerful!</i>

00:22:38.310 --> 00:22:40.480
TYPE: BEAST-MAN

00:22:40.650 --> 00:22:42.860
SPECIAL MOVE: JYUOKEN

00:22:43.360 --> 00:22:45.360
<i>Now, let's check this out!</i>

00:22:45.360 --> 00:22:48.070
<i>The bulging, massive pectorals
and deltoids,</i>

00:22:48.070 --> 00:22:51.930
<i>thick biceps like a log,
and beautifully shaped abdominals!</i>

00:22:51.930 --> 00:22:54.950
<i>If there's a Leomon Gym,
I'd love to go there!</i>

00:22:57.450 --> 00:22:59.870
<i>Which Digimon will it be next time?</i>

00:23:01.670 --> 00:23:05.360
<i>To save Gabumon
from being sacrificed in a cursed ritual,</i>

00:23:05.360 --> 00:23:07.970
<i>Yamato faces an unconquerable wall.</i>

00:23:07.970 --> 00:23:11.810
<i>Next time on Digimon Adventure:
"The Blazing Blue Friendship"</i>

00:23:11.810 --> 00:23:14.560
<i>The adventure continues to a new world.</i>
